{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16471","headline":"合肥至日愁中寄郑明府 · 刘商","name":"合肥至日愁中寄郑明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"失计爲卑吏，三年滞楚乡。\n不能随世俗，应是昧行藏。\n白璧空无玷，黄沙只自伤。\n暮天乡思乱，晓镜鬓毛苍。\n灰管移新律，穷阴变一阳。\n岁时人共换，幽愤日先长。\n拙宦惭知己，无媒悔自强。\n迍邅羞薄命，恩惠费余光。\n衆口诚难称，长川却易防。\n鱼竿今尚在，行此掉沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}